Second patch of the local copy third_party/metadata_god (apply after metadata_god-gradle9.patch).
The generated Dart code is from flutter_rust_bridge 2.11.1 and the Rust crate pins "=2.11.1", but the
package asks for "^2.11.1": pub then picks 2.13.0 and the runtime refuses to start
("codegen version (2.11.1) should be the same as runtime version (2.13.0)"). Pinning the exact version fixes it.

--- a/pubspec.yaml
+++ b/pubspec.yaml
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@
 dependencies:
   flutter:
     sdk: flutter
   ffi: ^2.1.4
-  flutter_rust_bridge: ^2.11.1
+  flutter_rust_bridge: 2.11.1
   uuid: ^4.5.1
   meta: ^1.16.0
